{
  "slug": "capi",
  "name": "Capi",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Capi the capybara teaches you a language above the prompt, one real-world fact per card",
  "longDescription": "A Claude Code mod: one hooks module, `hooks/register.js`, draws a quiz card in the band above the prompt and adds the `/capi` command. Each card teaches **one real-world fact** and **one expression** in the language you learn, explained in your own.\n\n- **Keys**: `1`–`4` answer, `6` grammar, `7` conjugations, `0` translation, `8` speech, `9` flags a wrong fact\n- **Repetition**: Leitner boxes (1, 3, 7, 30, 90 days); a miss returns after 20 minutes\n- **Cost**: cards come from `claude-opus-5-5` on your own plan\n\nSettings go in the plugin's `.env`. Needs Claude Code 2.1.287+ with mods on; speech and iCloud history sync are macOS only.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "hook",
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Daniel Deusing"
